\caption{The overall architecture of the proposed AutoView. The network is optimized by maximizing and minimizing the mutual information among different augmented views. The maximization of the mutual information can be achieved by the InfoMin loss, and the minimization is performed by the InfoMax loss.}
\label{fig:2}
